{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C", "description": "This file implements the interface functions for a Dslh Object Record, specifically functions related to parameter update status and retrieval of parameter values in different types, as well as functions to clear update indicators. It is part of a larger DSL Home Model implementation, handling interactions with parameters identified by name, including booleans, integers, strings, arrays, and handles.", "external_files": ["dslh_objro_global.h"], "external_methods": ["pMyObject->GetVarRecord", "pDslhRvqIf->GetParamValue"], "published": ["DslhObjroRvqIsParamUpdated", "DslhObjroRvqClearParamUpdated", "DslhObjroRvqGetParamValue", "DslhObjroRvqGetParamValueString", "DslhObjroRvqGetParamValueInt", "DslhObjroRvqGetParamValueUint32", "DslhObjroRvqGetParamValueBool", "DslhObjroRvqGetParamValueUint32Array", "DslhObjroRvqGetParamValueUcharArray", "DslhObjroRvqGetParamValueHandle"], "classes": [], "methods": [{"name": "BOOL DslhObjroRvqIsParamUpdated(ANSC_HANDLE hThisObject,char * pParamName)", "description": "Checks if a specific parameter was marked as updated (not yet cleared) by examining its 'bAlreadySet' flag and TempParamValue presence.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "ANSC_STATUS DslhObjroRvqClearParamUpdated(ANSC_HANDLE hThisObject,char * pParamName)", "description": "Marks a parameter as having been updated by setting its 'bAlreadySet' flag to TRUE.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "SLAP_VARIABLE * DslhObjroRvqGetParamValue(ANSC_HANDLE hThisObject,char * pParamName)", "description": "Returns the current (potentially modified) value of a parameter as a SLAP_VARIABLE pointer.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "char * DslhObjroRvqGetParamValueString(ANSC_HANDLE hThisObject,char * pParamName)", "description": "Retrieves the string representation of a parameter's value via an interface method.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int DslhObjroRvqGetParamValueInt(ANSC_HANDLE hThisObject,